SUMMARY:Joy is a Leadership Skill | Leadership on Tap
DESCRIPTION:AVL Digital Nomads\nFeeling fully alive at work isn’t option
 al—it’s your secret superpower. Yet most adults operate far below thei
 r potential\, trapped in stress\, endless meetings\, and the grind of “j
 ust keeping things moving.”\n\nIn this science-backed\, interactive sess
 ion\, Amy Dickens will show you how to reclaim your joy\, sharpen your pre
 sence\, and lead from a state that fuels focus\, decision-making\, and imp
 act.\n\nYou’ll learn how shifting your energy boosts your performance an
 d amplifies your team’s results—without adding more hours to your day.
 \nYou’ll leave with tools to:\n\n* Feel energized and fully engaged\, sh
 owing up with clarity and purpose\n* Build stronger connections and high-p
 erforming teams\n* Activate breakthrough thinking and innovation\n* Create
  flow and momentum\, making complex projects feel achievable\nJoy isn’t 
 a reward at the end—it’s the engine driving your projects\, ideas\, an
 d impact.\n\nLOCATION Change -\nHatch CoWorking\n\nWho's welcome?\nEveryon
 e! Whether you're leading in for-profit\, non-profit\, academia\, communit
 y organizations\, or entrepreneurship – or simply curious about leadersh
 ip – you're welcome to join us.\n\n* Hatch Coworking\n* Parking: Street 
 parking is free after 6 pm\n* Beverages: Alcoholic and non-alcoholic bever
 ages
