SUMMARY:Instructional Design Meetup
DESCRIPTION:AVL Digital Nomads\nHi Asheville Instructional Designers!\n\nO
 ur spring AIDC meeting is on the calendar. This meetup will focus on resil
 iency and durability in learning design\, a timely topic after a year full
  of change. Come ready to share your experiences and insights on where you
 've seen resilience and durability in our field.\nWe're excited to welcome
  our guest speaker\, Kristen M. Stevenson\, Ph.D.\, Executive Director of 
 Curriculum and Instruction at eLearningDOC.\n\n**When:** Wednesday\\\, Apr
 il 16 \\| 10:00–11:30 AM\n**Where:** 105 Fairview Road (Look for the old
  Blue Ridge Power sign at the entrance)\n\nWe hope to see you there!\n\n*O
 ur mission is to create a space where professionals in Instructional Desig
 n can build relationships\, share innovative ideas\, solve common challeng
 es\, and become an ongoing resource for one another.*
