SUMMARY:Classy Cocktails @ The Radical
DESCRIPTION:AVL Digital Nomads\n**Classy Cocktails at The Radical Rooftop 
 🍸✨**\n\n**Date and Time**\nThursday\, April 16th - 6:30 – 8:30 pm\n
 **Location**\nThe Radical Hotel – Rooftop Bar\n95 Roberts Street\, Ashev
 ille\, NC 28801\n\n**What this event is all about**\nYou know that feeling
  when you want to get out\, put on something cute\, sip something deliciou
 s\, and actually enjoy being a human around other humans again? Yeah… th
 is is that 😏\n\nThis month\, you are heading up to the rooftop at The R
 adical Hotel\, one of Asheville’s coolest spots\, where the vibe is equa
 l parts artsy\, edgy\, and effortlessly stylish. Think killer views\, crea
 tive cocktails\, and just enough boujee energy to make you feel like you
 ’ve got your life together… even if your to-do list says otherwise 
 😂\n\nThis is one of our group favorites for a reason. Great drinks\, gr
 eat atmosphere\, and even better people. No awkward networking\, no forced
  conversations. Just show up\, grab a drink\, and let the night unfold.\n\
 n**What you’re in for**\n🍹 Craft cocktails that make you pause mid-si
 p like… “okay wait\, this is GOOD”\n🌆 Rooftop views that remind y
 ou why Asheville is kind of a vibe\n😎 A laid-back\, social atmosphere w
 ith zero pressure to “perform”\n💬 Easy conversations\, spontaneous 
 connections\, and probably a few laughs you didn’t plan on\n✨ That per
 fect mix of chill and just a little bit fancy\n\n**Who this is for**\nYou 
 are a digital nomad\, remote worker\, creative\, entrepreneur\, or just so
 meone who wants to get out of the house and be around fun\, interesting pe
 ople without it turning into a business pitch fest.\nYou like good drinks\
 , good energy\, and good company. That’s the only requirement.\n\nCome a
 s you are\, bring a friend\, or roll solo and make a few new ones.\nEither
  way\, you’re not staying home that night 😉
