SUMMARY:Game Night at Booda's in Hendersonville
DESCRIPTION:AVL Digital Nomads\nIt's game time! Board game time\, that is.
  Join us at Booda's Brewing in Hendersonville for an evening of game playi
 ng\, friendly faces\, and maybe a little competition! Feel free to bring y
 our favorite game or grab one from Booda's stash. Look for the ADN sign\, 
 slap on a name tag and have some fun.
