SUMMARY:April Spring Fling at Sierra Nevada
DESCRIPTION:AVL Digital Nomads\nLet's celebrate this wonderful spring weat
 her in a glorious setting at Sierra Nevada's beer garden out in Mills Rive
 r. If you haven't experienced this beautiful setting\, you must join us fo
 r this event. Don't let the fact that it is a little outside of Asheville 
 keep you away.\n\nWe’ll organize tables on the back porch and put out ou
 r AVL Digital Nomads signs. As always\, we'll have name tags to help ease 
 introductions.\n\nWe're looking forward to another fun event of connection
  and meeting new people. Bring a friend or two and enjoy some food\, bever
 ages\, and scintillating conversation.\n\nIf this is your first time atten
 ding one of our events\, welcome!!!!\n\nHope to see you there!
